msgid "Underwater Sonar (Analog)"
msgstr "水下声呐（模拟）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:7
#: 28f9f07e3a264ddaa653607c54b4b134 2e44e817eb534eaeb86b1f6077d6a057
#: 7d96e7ab2bf44a149f3d948da8667af7 8a3d3658b108480db53ecf8a312f9dfe
#: 9bfaf206571d4e16837089e591eff3e3
msgid ""
"This page details the setup of a low-cost analog underwater sonar (aka "
"\"fish finder\") and a digitizer to convert the analog readings into NMEA "
"0183 which can be read by ardupilot.  This setup allows measuring the depth "
"of the water below a boat.  The sensor described has a maximum claimed a "
"range of 300m and a relatively wide beam of 22deg."
msgstr ""
"本页详细介绍低成本模拟水下声呐（即「鱼探仪」）的设置，以及将模拟读数转换为 ArduPilot 可读的 NMEA 0183 "
"格式的数字化仪。此设置可测量船只下方水的深度。所描述的传感器最大量程为 300m，波束角较宽为 22 度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:9
