"These instructions were provided by `OlavA at the bottom of this "
"ardupilot.org blog post <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/mapping-a-lake-"
"with-ardupilot/32401/34>`__"
msgstr ""
"这些说明由 `OlavA 在该 ardupilot.org 博客文章底部 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/mapping-a-lake-with-ardupilot/32401/34>`__ "
"提供"

