"The image below shows the pin-out of an airmar analog transducer, but the "
"pinout is the same as for the Lowrance HST-WSBL"
msgstr "下图显示的是 airmar 模拟换能器的引脚定义，但引脚排列与 Lowrance HST-WSBL 相同"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:28
#: 1ea82f0b123e41489951ae44a6e4fe10 6ea7852d06f94091888e2abaf4a165ea
#: 761d9efad4144878ad50c011a1deaec7 ad2fe2fc09054f73b70a07089425ed26
#: ba3f41d3b0924213a5790f8032c3164e
msgid ""
"The Lowrance HST-WSBL pins should be connected to the pins on the right side"
" of the DST-2, as shown below.   Note that the Lowrance HST-WSBL does not "
"have a speed sensor so only pins 1 and 4-7 should be connected"
msgstr ""
"Lowrance HST-WSBL 的引脚应如下图所示连接到 DST-2 右侧的引脚。注意 Lowrance HST-WSBL "
"没有速度传感器，因此只需连接引脚 1 和 4-7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:32
#: 1c0ac70581294aa89d625f88e07ae032 2b87bd3cd6264fdbb5aae0a09f095b2b
#: 41e2373dfc6d4c73b5e576bdaea442ed 6e63eed4309c46e5a5412df5983d2678
#: 778552efc0384a2daac67139ed7b1a37
msgid ""
"The DST-2 requires a 10V to 28V power source, meaning it can be powered from"
" a 3S or 4S lipo battery."
msgstr "DST-2 需要 10V 至 28V 的电源，可由 3S 或 4S 锂聚合物电池供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-sonar-analog.rst:34
#: 69cb004e413947ae919d2b8194092279 a9700a0031464775bd2025dd5638519e
#: af6db012bae8426695802c92d62d1f00 b9485c5237974066a39aeb1f0438b8c6
#: c8706c12813e4339ac33e59e9da4b0d6
msgid ""
"Next pins on the left side of the DST-2 (serial and RS-232 output) should be"
" connected to the autopilot's telemetry/serial input. The easiest connection"
" method is to connect the DST-2's 5V serial output directly to the telemetry"
" port of the autopilot's Tx, Rx, and common ground.  It is best to check the"
" DST-2 docs before connecting but below shows how the telemetry pins from a "
"Pixhawk (or another autopilot) should be connected to the pins on the left "
"side of the DST-2."
msgstr ""
"接下来，DST-2 左侧的引脚（串口和 RS-232 输出）应连接到飞控的数传/串口输入。最简单的连接方式是将 DST-2 的 5V "
"串口输出直接连接到飞控数传端口的 Tx、Rx 和公共地。建议在连接前查阅 DST-2 文档，下图显示了 Pixhawk（或其他飞控）数传引脚应如何连接到"
" DST-2 左侧引脚。"

